      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Before an app can be distributed to external testers, it must be reviewed by Apple. A `betaAppReviewDetails` resource contains the information Apple requires when you submit a build for review, including a demo account login and contact details in case the reviewer has questions.",
